{\fSwis721 Cn BT|b1|i0|c0|p34;\LCONCRETE AND REINFORCEMENT}\P6. CONCRETE: CYLINDER STRENGTH AT 28 DAYS AS NOTED BELOW. CEMENT CEM-I 52.5N. MAXIMUM AGGREGATE 20 mm, SLUMP 100 %%P 25 mm.\P7. REINFORCEMENT: DEFORMED BARS TO BDS ISO 6935-2.\P8. BAR LETTE
  3
RS: T AND Y BOTH MEAN A DEFORMED BAR OF THE DIAMETER THAT FOLLOWS (T16 = Y16 = 16%%C). A SECOND DRAUGHTSMAN'S SHEET MAY MIX THEM ON ONE LINE.\P9. LEGACY IMPERIAL BAR CALLS: #3 = 10%%C, #4 = 12%%C, #5 = 16%%C, #6 = 20%%C, #8 = 25%%C.\P10. WELDED HOOKS
  1
 ARE NOT PERMITTED. ALL HOOKS 135%%D WHERE SHOWN ON S-03.\P
  7
Swis721 Cn BT
